OL,3,GNEWSASecret WW2 plotting room under
OL,4,Acliffs opens to public
OL,5,
OL,6,FA World War Two plotting room hidden
OL,7,Funder the White Cliffs of Dover has
OL,8,Fopened to visitors for the first time.
OL,10,FBuilt in 1940, the Fan Bay Plotting
OL,11,FRoom was a war operation centre which
OL,12,Fhelped direct guns defending the Strait
OL,13,Fof Dover as Britain's front line
OL,14,Ffollowing the fall of France.
OL,16,FIt was abandoned after the war and
OL,17,Fburied under soil in the 1970s, until
OL,18,Fit was unearthed in 2017 and became the
OL,19,Ffocus of National Trust research and
OL,20,Fconservation.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
