OL,3,GNEWSASecret WW2 plotting room under
OL,4,Acliffs opens to public
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe room opened to the public on Friday
OL,7,Fand has been conserved in such a way
OL,8,Fthat it is "much as we found it", the
OL,9,FNational Trust said.
